  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"card\">\n  <h1>Pixel Calculator</h1>\n  <form id=\"calc-form\" novalidate>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"left\">Left number</label>\n      <input id=\"left\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. -3.5\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n      <select id=\"operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"right\">Right number</label>\n      <input id=\"right\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 2\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"submit\">Calculate</button>\n  </form>\n  <output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n</main>\n<script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #29366f;\n  --accent: #41a6f6;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --error: #ef7d57;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n}\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 20px;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n.field { margin-bottom: 16px; }\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\ninput, select, button {\n  width: 100%;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\nbutton {\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.05s;\n}\nbutton:hover { filter: brightness(1.15); }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(2px, 2px); }\n#result {\n  display: block;\n  margin-top: 20px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  min-height: 60px;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n#result[data-error=\"true\"] { color: var(--error); }\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card { padding: 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  var form = document.getElementById('calc-form');\n  var leftInput = document.getElementById('left');\n  var rightInput = document.getElementById('right');\n  var operation = document.getElementById('operation');\n  var result = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function parseNumber(value) {\n    if (value.trim() === '') return NaN;\n    var num = Number(value);\n    return isFinite(num) ? num : NaN;\n  }\n\n  function calculate() {\n    var left = parseNumber(leftInput.value);\n    var right = parseNumber(rightInput.value);\n    var op = operation.value;\n    var output;\n\n    if (isNaN(left) || isNaN(right)) {\n      output = 'Error';\n    } else {\n      switch (op) {\n        case 'add': output = left + right; break;\n        case 'subtract': output = left - right; break;\n        case 'multiply': output = left * right; break;\n        case 'divide':\n          if (right === 0) { output = 'Error'; }\n          else { output = left / right; }\n          break;\n        default: output = 'Error';\n      }\n    }\n\n    if (output === 'Error') {\n      result.textContent = 'Error';\n      result.setAttribute('data-error', 'true');\n    } else {\n      result.textContent = String(output);\n      result.removeAttribute('data-error');\n    }\n  }\n\n  form.addEventListener('submit', function (event) {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    calculate();\n  });\n})();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Two-Number Calculator\n\nA tiny offline pixel-style calculator built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No packages, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a number in **Left number** (negatives allowed).\n3. Choose an operation: add, subtract, multiply, or divide.\n4. Enter a number in **Right number**.\n5. Click **Calculate** (or press Enter). The result appears below.\n\nInvalid input (empty, non-numeric, non-finite) or division by zero shows exactly `Error`.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and required element IDs\n- `style.css` — pixel-themed responsive styles\n- `script.js` — calculation and validation logic\n- `README.md` — this file\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All controls have visible labels.\n- Keyboard accessible; visible focus states.\n- Result uses `aria-live` for screen reader updates.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Under 200 total lines.\n- No external assets, imports, or packages.\n- Works from 360px wide.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
